    "group": "Cobra",
    "summary": "In [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), the D-impaler resolves like this:\n\n- after you pick the D-impaler's target, roll a D6 for that unit and for each other unit up to 3\" from it; on a 5+, a D-rift hits the unit rolled for\n- once this model finishes its attacks on that target, each unit a D-rift hit in this phase takes D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**",
